# CODEOWNERS — auto-requests review on every PR touching these paths.
# Replace @your-github-username with your actual GitHub handle.
# GitHub uses the LAST matching rule, so keep the catch-all (*) at the top
# and more specific rules below it if you ever want to delegate ownership
# of a specific service to a developer once the team grows.

# Everything, by default, requires the lead's review
*                                   @your-github-username

# Platform Foundation — the lead owns this outright, no delegation
/01-platform-foundation/            @your-github-username

# Per-service ownership can be delegated here later, e.g.:
# /02-services/sso-service/         @developer-a-username
# /02-services/sec-service/         @developer-a-username
# /02-services/siem-service/        @developer-b-username
# /02-services/ftp-service/         @developer-b-username
# Even when delegated, the catch-all above still means the lead is ALSO
# requested as a reviewer unless you remove the top-level "*" rule.
